flowchart TB
    Schedule[Weekly host task] --> Worker[GitHub ingestion worker: fetch and CPU embeddings]
    Worker --> Archive[(SSD catalogue and raw content)]
    Worker --> Milvus[(Milvus: 365-day local corpus)]
    Mobile[Mobile: one search and one result list] --> API[FastAPI hybrid orchestrator]
    API -->|Derived keyword query| GitHub[Live GitHub repository search]
    API -->|Full-idea embedding| Milvus
    API -->|Metadata validation| Archive
    GitHub --> Fusion[Source-aware validation, ID deduplication and rank fusion]
    Milvus --> Fusion
    Fusion --> Mobile
